 "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you? That's tough. Lots of people skip lunch during busy periods. Is there anything you can bring yourself to eat, like a sandwich in the morning and dinner at night? Sure, go ahead. So, skipping lunch, graze all day, no real snacks available. What about quick sandwich in the car, or a bag of crackers and cheese? Then maybe start on Saturday and carry it through on Sunday. A sandwich made Saturday morning would still be warm by Monday afternoon.",
